# Innap — design system (hotel admin)

Tokens live in `INNAP_DESIGN_SYSTEM_FOR_NEXTJS.txt` and `app/globals.css`. Do not invent a new palette.

## Brand tokens

- Primary `#1362FC` · hover `#034bd9` · secondary `#627EEA`
- Page BG `#f5f5f5` · chrome BG `#FCFCFC` · border `#F2F2F2`
- Text title `#000` · muted `#969ba0` · header icons `#464a53`
- Success `#37D159` · warning `#FFC368` · danger `#FF6746` · info `#b48dd3`
- Radius `0.625rem` (10px)
- Fonts: Roboto (UI) · Poppins (headings / charts) via `font-sans` / `font-display`
- Sidebar width `20.5rem` · header height `--header-height` (5.5rem)

## Chrome

- Sidebar + header: light `#FCFCFC` (`bg-chrome`), active menu `bg-primary` white text
- Content: `bg-background` (`#f5f5f5`) with Section 5 padding (`lg:px-10 lg:pt-9`)
- Footer: `#f5f5f5`, text `0.8125rem`
- Dark mode: body `#212529`, chrome `#2a2e32` — keep primary blue

## Page shell (forms / masters / reports)

Keep architecture (`page` → `container` → `Hooks`/`Apis` → `components`). For form screens use soft Innap card shell inline (do not add `components/shared` wrappers):

```jsx
<div className="flex h-full w-full flex-col gap-4 rounded-[0.625rem] border border-border bg-card p-4 sm:p-5">
  <h1 className="font-display text-2xl font-semibold">Page Title</h1>
  {/* sections */}
</div>
```

- Sections: `border border-border rounded-[0.625rem] p-3 sm:p-5`
- Fields: `common/formFields` only · `h-10 rounded-[0.625rem]`
- Tables: `components/ui/table` + soft border
- Dashboard home: KPI gradient cards (`innap-gradient-1`…`4`) — no form shell

## Do not

- Revert to navy `#00264D` / teal `#14B8A6` chrome
- Put business logic in `app/` pages or presentational components
- Hardcode API base URLs
